{
    "title": "State.io \u2014 Conquer the World",
    "description": "Welcome to State .io, the epic strategy game that lets you conquer an alternative world! In this cell battle game, you'll command your troops to capture all the states while challenging your logic and reaction time.\r\n\r\nState .io is an abstract real-time strategy game, a tactical clash of dots, and an exciting countries takeover. Fight against armies by solving strategic puzzles to beat your rivals and expand your superiority in the world arena. Lead your army to victory in this epic battle game and become a war strategy winner!\r\n\r\nYou'll conquer countries and territories, block and destroy your opponents' towers, attack enemy lands, and defend your borders. Be smart and brave in this tactical and logical cell conquest! Each of your actions will have consequences, so be a true strategist in attacks and defense.\r\n\r\nThis war simulator demands tactics, not power. You are to use your brain, not muscles. Become a hero by solving tactical dot puzzles! You will definitely have a lot of fun struggling on different maps we have added especially for you.\r\n\r\nBe on top enjoying our free RTS online, playing 1v1 on first levels and competing against more opponents on further levels.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to complete this great conquest and make your domination story? Then download the game to begin your strategic expansion. \r\n\r\nThink strategically and react quickly while conquering states and territories in the epic clash game!\r\n\r\n*The game is designed for entertainment purposes only. Any similarities to the real world and geopolitical situations are coincidental.*\r\n\r\nPlease note: the game requires a permanent Internet connection.\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://aigames.ae/policy\r\n\r\n______________________\r\n<b>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</b>\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to State .io, the epic strategy game that lets you conquer an alternative world! In this cell battle game, you&#39;ll command your troops to capture all the states while challenging your logic and reaction time.<br><br>State .io is an abstract real-time strategy game, a tactical clash of dots, and an exciting countries takeover. Fight against armies by solving strategic puzzles to beat your rivals and expand your superiority in the world arena. Lead your army to victory in this epic battle game and become a war strategy winner!<br><br>You&#39;ll conquer countries and territories, block and destroy your opponents&#39; towers, attack enemy lands, and defend your borders. Be smart and brave in this tactical and logical cell conquest! Each of your actions will have consequences, so be a true strategist in attacks and defense.<br><br>This war simulator demands tactics, not power. You are to use your brain, not muscles. Become a hero by solving tactical dot puzzles! You will definitely have a lot of fun struggling on different maps we have added especially for you.<br><br>Be on top enjoying our free RTS online, playing 1v1 on first levels and competing against more opponents on further levels.<br><br>Are you ready to complete this great conquest and make your domination story? Then download the game to begin your strategic expansion. <br><br>Think strategically and react quickly while conquering states and territories in the epic clash game!<br><br>*The game is designed for entertainment purposes only. Any similarities to the real world and geopolitical situations are coincidental.*<br><br>Please note: the game requires a permanent Internet connection.<br><br>Privacy policy: https://aigames.ae/policy<br><br>______________________<br><b>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</b><br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games<br>YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
